    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LOCATION! LOCATION! LOCATION!\r\nMURPHY MULLAN are delighted to present this bright and airy two bed apartment to the market. \r\n\r\nNo 6 has a number of bonus features including its excellent location overlooking the Phoenix Park, allocated parking and B BER rating making this one for the short list!\r\n\r\nThe location is simply superb with the Phoenix Park on its door step providing both country and city living in the heart of Dublin with stunning walks and scenery.  There are excellent local schools and a host of shops and necessary amenities. With an excellent public transport system to and from Dublin City Centre with both the N3 and M50 close by providing easy access to most route ways.  Broombridge green luas line is only 15 minutes’ walk making many locations easily accessible.\r\n\r\nWell-proportioned accommodation includes entrance hallway, main bathroom, living room, kitchen / dining room. \r\n\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway: Laminated flooring\r\nLiving Room:\tLaminated flooring / Double doors leading to balcony\r\nKitchen: Fully fitted kitchen presses top and bottom\r\nStorage Room: Laminated flooring\r\nGarage: Allocated carspace\r\nBedroom 1: Laminated flooring. Built in wardrobes\r\nBedroom 2:  Laminated flooring. Built in wardrobes\r\nMain bathroom: Fully tiled bathroom / double shower cubicle / WHB / WC / Storage\r\nOutside:\r\nFront:  On street and allocated parking in garage.\r\nRear: Sunny South west facing balcony overlooking the Phoenix Park."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "South West facing balcony overlooking Phoenix Park\r\nHighly Sought After, Mature Residential Area\r\nBroombridge Luas Green Line 10 min drive\r\nStoneybatter/Smithfield Red Luas Line 10/15 min drive\r\nDublin City Centre approx 15mins by bus\r\nHost of excellent local Primary and Secondary schools"
      },
      {
